{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect cards, build decks, and battle fierce opponents in Top Check, a chess inspired rogue-like deck builder and online collectable card game.\u00a0 Demonstrate your deck building prowess in the <strong>rogue-like</strong> Challenge Run game mode.\u00a0 Or clash with adversaries <strong>online</strong> using your favorite constructed deck.\u00a0 With a plethora of new pieces and unique abilities, only the best strategists will emerge victorious. Do you have what it takes to reach the top?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rich tactical combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Constructed deckbuilding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A tutorial to guide you as a new player</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A 1v1  AI Battle mode to test new decks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A dedicated rogue-like game mode with deckbuilding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Online PvP with MMR-based matchmaking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tons of new pieces and unique abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cosmetic options to personalize your in-game experience</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3432200?t=1744937661","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3432200?t=1744937661","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432200/74a431c759f9032d8b8cfd937f416cb91b6c2bb1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744937661","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432200/74a431c759f9032d8b8cfd937f416cb91b6c2bb1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744937661","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"n